{"seq":1,"slug":"postpurchase-journey-stage-touchpoint","title":"购后旅程阶段划分与关键触点建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/post-purchase-engagement-experience-hub/postpurchase-journey-model/postpurchase-journey-stage-touchpoint","wordCount":2634,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"购后旅程阶段划分与关键触点建模\">购后旅程阶段划分与关键触点建模</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-从-订单状态-到-购后旅程\">核心概念：从「订单状态」到「购后旅程」</h2><p>跨境电商的后端系统里有一套天然存在的东西——订单状态机和物流状态机。订单从 <code>pending</code> 走到 <code>fulfilled</code>，包裹从 <code>pre_transit</code> 走到 <code>delivered</code>（EasyPost Tracker 的十档状态含 <code>pre_transit</code>、<code>in_transit</code>、<code>out_for_delivery</code>、<code>delivered</code>、<code>available_for_pickup</code>、<code>return_to_sender</code>、<code>failure</code> 等，见 <a href=\"https://docs.easypost.com/docs/trackers\">docs.easypost.com/docs/trackers</a>）。这些状态是<strong>履约系统的事实</strong>，不是<strong>用户的心理位置</strong>。</p>\n<p>购后旅程模型要回答一个不同的问题：<strong>包裹在途的每一刻，用户处在哪个认知阶段，此刻该由哪个触点、用哪个渠道、说什么？</strong> 前者是数据库字段，后者是编排决策。把两者混为一谈是购后体验系统最常见的建模错误——它会让「订单已发货」这类系统事件被直接翻译成用户消息，于是用户在包裹其实还躺在分拣中心时就收到「您的包裹马上到」。</p>\n<p>两者的差异是结构性的：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>订单/物流状态机</th>\n<th>购后旅程阶段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>真相来源</td>\n<td>履约系统、承运商扫描</td>\n<td>用户认知与预期管理需求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间语义</td>\n<td>事件发生时刻</td>\n<td>关注窗口（interval）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变更频率</td>\n<td>随扫描更新，可能一天多次</td>\n<td>数天一跳，跨周甚至跨月</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消费方</td>\n<td>仓储、客服、财务</td>\n<td>消息编排器、CRM、增长实验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>失败模式</td>\n<td>状态缺失（丢扫描）</td>\n<td>触点错时（早发=噪声，晚发=无效）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>旅程阶段描述的是<strong>时间区间</strong>，设进入时刻为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{in}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、退出时刻为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{out}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，驻留时长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D(S) = t_{out}(S) - t_{in}(S)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 直接决定触点密度上限——「运输在途」期望驻留 4 天而只配 1 个触点，密度是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.25</span></span></span></span></span>/天；同样阶段在跨境线路（如中国至巴西）上可达 18 天，密度降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.056</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.056</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.056</span></span></span></span></span>/天。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;支付完成&lt;br/&gt;订单已确认&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;打包出库&lt;br/&gt;拿到运单号&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;跨境干线运输&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D[&quot;目的国清关&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; E[&quot;本地派送&lt;br/&gt;out_for_delivery&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; F{&quot;妥投?&quot;}&#10;  F -- 是 --&gt; G[&quot;收货确认&lt;br/&gt;开箱与安装&quot;]&#10;  F -- 否 --&gt; H[&quot;派送失败/无人签收&quot;]&#10;  H --&gt; I[&quot;改期或自提点&quot;]&#10;  I --&gt; E&#10;  G --&gt; J[&quot;使用与评价窗口&quot;]&#10;  J --&gt; K[&quot;复购/推荐触发&quot;]\">graph TD\n  A[\"支付完成&lt;br/&gt;订单已确认\"] --&gt; B[\"打包出库&lt;br/&gt;拿到运单号\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"跨境干线运输\"]\n  C --&gt; D[\"目的国清关\"]\n  D --&gt; E[\"本地派送&lt;br/&gt;out_for_delivery\"]\n  E --&gt; F{\"妥投?\"}\n  F -- 是 --&gt; G[\"收货确认&lt;br/&gt;开箱与安装\"]\n  F -- 否 --&gt; H[\"派送失败/无人签收\"]\n  H --&gt; I[\"改期或自提点\"]\n  I --&gt; E\n  G --&gt; J[\"使用与评价窗口\"]\n  J --&gt; K[\"复购/推荐触发\"]</pre><p>这张图的关键分叉在 F 节点：<strong>妥投前的旅程是线性的，妥投后是分叉的</strong>。多数团队把模型建到 E 就停，于是评价激励和复购触达只能凭运营日历拍脑袋。</p>\n<h2 id=\"阶段划分粒度-里程碑-状态机与信号\">阶段划分粒度：里程碑、状态机与信号</h2><p>粒度选择的判据只有一个：<strong>阶段边界是否对应一次真实的触点决策</strong>。两个阶段之间若不存在「该说什么」的差异，就该合并。实践中可落地的划分通常收敛到 6–9 个阶段，一个跨品类基线是：订单确认 → 打包出库 → 干线运输 → 目的国清关 → 派送中 → 妥投确认 → 开箱/安装 → 首次使用 → 评价与复购。前六个由履约事件驱动（硬边界），后三个由时间驱动（软边界，必须用计时器推进）。</p>\n<p>软边界是这个模型里最容易被忽略的部分。妥投后的阶段没有事件可依赖，只能靠 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{delivered} + \\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 的计时器推进，而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 在不同品类上差一个数量级：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>推进触发</th>\n<th>典型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>品类敏感性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>订单确认 → 妥投确认</td>\n<td>履约事件（<code>orders/create</code>、<code>delivered</code> 等），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开箱安装</td>\n<td>计时器</td>\n<td>1–3 天</td>\n<td>高（大家电 &gt; 服饰）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>首次使用</td>\n<td>计时器</td>\n<td>3–7 天</td>\n<td>高（耗材 &gt; 一次性商品）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>评价窗口</td>\n<td>计时器</td>\n<td>7–14 天</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复购窗口</td>\n<td>计时器</td>\n<td>品类消耗周期</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Shopify 的 webhook 模型天然支持前五个硬边界：<code>orders/create</code>、<code>fulfillments/create</code>、<code>fulfillments/update</code>、<code>fulfillment_events/create</code>（见 <a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/api/webhooks\">shopify.dev/docs/api/webhooks</a>）。这里有一个陷阱：<strong>fulfillment 对象上 <code>status</code> 与 <code>shipment_status</code> 是两个正交字段</strong>——前者是履约处理状态（<code>pending</code>、<code>open</code>、<code>success</code>、<code>cancelled</code>、<code>error</code>、<code>failure</code>），后者才是承运商物理状态（<code>label_printed</code>、<code>in_transit</code>、<code>delivered</code> 等，见 <a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/api/admin-rest/latest/resources/fulfillment\">shopify.dev/docs/api/admin-rest/latest/resources/fulfillment</a>）。把 <code>status = success</code> 当作「已送达」去触发妥投触点，会在包裹还在跨太平洋的飞机上时给用户发出妥投通知。</p>\n<p>阶段推进器应是一个<strong>幂等的信号归约器</strong>：输入订单事件流，输出「当前阶段 + 进入时间」。两个性质必须满足——同一事件重复投递不改变阶段（幂等），阶段只单调前进或显式回退（不回跳）。回退真实存在：派送失败把阶段拉回等待改派，清关异常把 stage 标记为 blocked；没有回退路径的模型在一次派送失败后彻底失准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"触点建模三要素-事件-渠道-时机\">触点建模三要素：事件、渠道、时机</h2><p>一个触点（touchpoint）不是「一条消息」，而是三元组 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>E</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>C</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(E, C, W)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：触发事件 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span>、投递渠道 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>、时机窗口 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>。三者必须分开建模，因为变更原因完全不同——事件由履约系统改，渠道由业务策略改，时机由实验改。</p>\n<p><strong>触发事件</strong>分两类：事件驱动型由履约信号触发，延迟接近实时；时间驱动型由计时器触发，需显式定义时区与静默时段。跨境的麻烦在于时区——若消息按仓库当地时间生成，「合理」的触达会落在收件人的深夜，因此<strong>静默时段必须以收件人当地时间为准</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>渠道选择</strong>遵循一条几乎总是正确的排序原则：越靠近履约事实的消息越走「可被主动查询」的渠道（tracking 页、订单详情页、App 消息中心），越靠近关系维护的消息才走「主动打断」的渠道（邮件、推送、短信）。用户在「包裹到哪了」阶段是主动来的，在「该评价了」阶段需要推力。\n<strong>时机窗口</strong>的核心约束是触点疲劳。设窗口 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 内收到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个触点，退订概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{opt}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">pt</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 单调上升且边际递增，可用饱和模型近似：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><msup><mi>n</mi><mi>α</mi></msup></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>α</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{opt}(n) = 1 - e^{-\\lambda n^{\\alpha}}, \\quad \\alpha &gt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">pt</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1244em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.93em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7385em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.931em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha &gt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 意味着第 5 个触点造成的伤害大于第 1 个的 5 倍。实践中这条约束被实现为<strong>频次上限（frequency cap）</strong>：同一用户在同一 24 小时内、跨所有购后触点最多 N 条主动消息，且同一物流事件不得由两个触点重复消费。频次上限必须放在编排器层而非渠道层——渠道层各管各的，用户收到的是三条渠道各自合规、合起来却是轰炸的消息。</p>\n<h2 id=\"关键触点的编排-从事件到决策\">关键触点的编排：从事件到决策</h2><p>把三要素落到编排器上，一次触点决策是一条流水线：事件进入 → 解析阶段 → 命中触点规则 → 检查频次与静默时段 → 选择渠道 → 渲染内容 → 投递并记账。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;履约事件流&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;阶段归约器&lt;br/&gt;幂等 + 单调&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C{&quot;阶段是否变化?&quot;}&#10;  C -- 否 --&gt; D[&quot;丢弃: 无触点语义&quot;]&#10;  C -- 是 --&gt; E[&quot;匹配触点规则表&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; F{&quot;频次上限&lt;br/&gt;未超?&quot;}&#10;  F -- 否 --&gt; G[&quot;抑制: 记 suppressed&quot;]&#10;  F -- 是 --&gt; H{&quot;当地人静默时段?&quot;}&#10;  H -- 是 --&gt; I[&quot;延迟到窗口开启&quot;]&#10;  H -- 否 --&gt; J[&quot;渠道选择&quot;]&#10;  J --&gt; K[&quot;渲染: 本地化 + 变量注入&quot;]&#10;  K --&gt; L[&quot;投递&quot;]&#10;  L --&gt; M[&quot;记账: 触点日志&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"履约事件流\"] --&gt; B[\"阶段归约器&lt;br/&gt;幂等 + 单调\"]\n  B --&gt; C{\"阶段是否变化?\"}\n  C -- 否 --&gt; D[\"丢弃: 无触点语义\"]\n  C -- 是 --&gt; E[\"匹配触点规则表\"]\n  E --&gt; F{\"频次上限&lt;br/&gt;未超?\"}\n  F -- 否 --&gt; G[\"抑制: 记 suppressed\"]\n  F -- 是 --&gt; H{\"当地人静默时段?\"}\n  H -- 是 --&gt; I[\"延迟到窗口开启\"]\n  H -- 否 --&gt; J[\"渠道选择\"]\n  J --&gt; K[\"渲染: 本地化 + 变量注入\"]\n  K --&gt; L[\"投递\"]\n  L --&gt; M[\"记账: 触点日志\"]</pre><p>这条流水线里有两个位置最容易出问题。其一是 <strong>C 节点的丢弃逻辑</strong>：同一「派送中」状态可能被承运商反复上报，若不按「阶段变化」去重而是按「事件到达」触发，用户会在一天内收到同一语义的三条通知。其二是 <strong>M 节点的记账</strong>：触点日志必须记录「哪条规则、哪个事件、哪个渠道、发了什么」，否则频次上限无法计算，被抑制（suppressed）的触点也无法回溯——而抑制率恰恰是评估触点规则表是否过密的唯一证据。闭环还需要一个比投递回执更硬的信号：「用户在收到派送通知后 24 小时内打开了 tracking 页」，它计量的是用户主动行为，受标题党干扰小。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与外部标准的对齐-schema-org-与监管边界\">与外部标准的对齐：schema.org 与监管边界</h2><p>自建旅程模型不必从零定义词汇。schema.org 已为「订单—包裹—事件」提供可复用的骨架：<code>Order</code> 承载 <code>orderNumber</code>、<code>orderDate</code>、<code>orderStatus</code>、<code>orderDelivery</code>、<code>customer</code>、<code>seller</code>（<code>merchant</code> 与 <code>vendor</code> 已被 <code>seller</code> 取代）；<code>ParcelDelivery</code> 承载 <code>trackingNumber</code>、<code>trackingUrl</code>、<code>provider</code>、<code>deliveryAddress</code>、<code>expectedArrivalFrom</code>、<code>expectedArrivalUntil</code>、<code>deliveryStatus</code>（<code>carrier</code> 已被 <code>provider</code> 取代）。<code>OrderStatus</code> 的枚举含 <code>OrderProcessing</code>、<code>OrderInTransit</code>、<code>OrderDelivered</code>、<code>OrderReturned</code> 等八项（见 <a href=\"https://schema.org/Order\">schema.org/Order</a>、<a href=\"https://schema.org/ParcelDelivery\">schema.org/ParcelDelivery</a>、<a href=\"https://schema.org/OrderStatus\">schema.org/OrderStatus</a>）。</p>\n<p>这套词汇的价值在于<strong>它强迫你把「预计到达」建模成区间（<code>expectedArrivalFrom</code> / <code>expectedArrivalUntil</code>）而不是点</strong>。跨境线路的预计到达本就是区间：点状承诺（「10 月 12 日送达」）会在任何一次清关延误时被自己的承诺反噬；区间承诺（「10 月 9 日–14 日送达」）把不确定性显式传递给用户，反而降低 WISMO 工单。</p>\n<p>监管边界同样落在触点模型里。欧盟《消费者权利指令》2011/83/EU 第 9 条给消费者 14 天无理由撤销权，第 18 条规定经营者一般应在 30 天内交付（见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Consumer_Rights_Directive_2011\">Consumer Rights Directive 2011/83/EU</a>）。这两个数字是硬约束而非运营参数：14 天撤销窗口必须在「评价激励」触点之前闭合，否则你会在用户仍可无理由退货时激励他评价，产生一批随后被撤销的评价。评价触点受更严约束——美国 FTC 的消费者评价与证言规则（16 CFR Part 465，2024 年 8 月 22 日发布）把「购买评价」「内部人评价未披露」「评价压制」列为违法或欺骗行为，其中 § 465.7 禁止以低评分或负面倾向为由隐藏评价、同时暗示展示的评价代表了全部（见 <a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/cfr/text/16/part-465\">16 CFR Part 465</a>）。英国《2024 年数字市场、竞争与消费者法》亦禁止虚假评价（2024 年 5 月 24 日获御准，见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Digital_Markets,_Competition_and_Consumers_Act_2024\">DMCC Act 2024</a>）。因此评价触点必须带三个字段：<strong>可评价起始时间</strong>（妥投 + 撤销窗口之后）、<strong>激励披露要求</strong>、<strong>抑制策略的合法性标记</strong>（只允许中性标准如垃圾内容，不允许按评分高低）。这三者是合规约束而非运营偏好，不能交给运营在后台随意调。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>购后旅程阶段与订单/物流状态机是两套模型：前者是编排决策的输入，后者是履约事实的真相源，不能用后者直接驱动用户消息。</li>\n<li>硬边界阶段（订单确认到妥投）由履约 webhook 驱动且可幂等推进；软边界阶段（开箱、首次使用、评价、复购）由计时器驱动，其 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 强烈依赖品类与线路时长。</li>\n<li>阶段归约器必须幂等、单调或显式回退；按「阶段变化」去重而非按「事件到达」触发，避免同一语义重复轰炸。</li>\n<li>触点 = 触发事件 + 渠道 + 时机窗口；渠道选择遵循「履约事实可查询，关系维护才打断」，静默时段以收件人当地时间计算。</li>\n<li>频次上限必须在编排器层跨渠道统一计算，触点日志必须记录规则、事件、渠道与抑制状态。</li>\n<li>评价与复购触点受外部规则硬约束：欧盟 14 天撤销权、30 天交付期，FTC 16 CFR Part 465 对激励披露与评价压制的禁止——这些是字段级合规约束，不是可调参数。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"购后旅程阶段划分与关键触点建模","id":"购后旅程阶段划分与关键触点建模"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从「订单状态」到「购后旅程」","id":"核心概念-从-订单状态-到-购后旅程"},{"level":2,"text":"阶段划分粒度：里程碑、状态机与信号","id":"阶段划分粒度-里程碑-状态机与信号"},{"level":2,"text":"触点建模三要素：事件、渠道、时机","id":"触点建模三要素-事件-渠道-时机"},{"level":2,"text":"关键触点的编排：从事件到决策","id":"关键触点的编排-从事件到决策"},{"level":2,"text":"与外部标准的对齐：schema.org 与监管边界","id":"与外部标准的对齐-schema-org-与监管边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"购后事件总线与旅程状态机编排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/post-purchase-engagement-experience-hub/postpurchase-journey-model/postpurchase-event-bus-state-machine"}}